{"duration_api_ms":104439,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"49e90cbf-bd71-4199-bb26-71a52329c345","total_cost_usd":0.172184,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16440,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":10642,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":6132},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16440,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":10642,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16440,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16440},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":10642,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":16440,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.172184,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":6132,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The front is a one-parameter curve. Every non-dominated point sits at the corner D≈3.3852 m, bluntness 1.2, cone 70°, and only gamma varies from -1.5 to -3.5702 deg. The three limits box the corner in. Mass fraction caps D at about 3.3852 m, with a margin of 1.5e-5. Bluntness above 1.2 fails geometry or aero-hull checks. Cone is at its 70 deg bound. Peak g is about 12 at gamma -3.5702. Moves off the corner are dominated or infeasible: lower bluntness or cone violates mass fraction, and smaller D raises flux and temperature. Round 6 and 7 gains were about 1e-4 in normalised hypervolume, so only gap-filling along gamma remains.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-895ab2d00f94 (gamma -1.5) to C-3da19764396f (gamma -3.5702): flux rises 227.2k to 274.6k W/m2 and bondline T falls 417.9 to 391.1 K, all at D=3.3852, b=1.2, cone 70.\",\"C-3da19764396f has g margin 1.2e-5 and mass-fraction margin 1.5e-5, so the corner is bounded on both.\",\"C-8efdd90862a0, C-099cae65259a and C-26610a6c01d5: lower b or cone at D=3.384 gives negative mass-fraction margin and no flux gain.\",\"C-114b79b08144 (D 3.2, gamma -3.7) violates g at 12.14, and C-7e930f570744 shows that smaller D with steeper gamma does not reduce T.\",\"C-f986776067bd, C-9c1cc1a27672, C-207a027e9dd5 and C-4d9cd4c2b38d: b above 1.2 at cone 70 fails on geometry or surrogate extrapolation.\",\"Sparse gamma spans remain at -2.72 to -2.95, -2.95 to -3.16, -2.36 to -2.56, -1.92 to -2.08 and -3.16 to -3.34.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Flux falls with nose radius (b*D/2) and lower ballistic coefficient. Bondline T follows heat load, so it falls with larger D and a steeper, shorter pulse. Peak g is set almost entirely by gamma at about 1.67 g/deg, so gamma at the g=12 limit traces the trade-off. With D, b and cone pinned at their bounds, the remaining hypervolume comes from densifying the gamma sweep. I interpolated flux and T between neighbouring evaluated points, since both vary smoothly and monotonically with gamma at fixed geometry. This is data-driven interpolation, not prior physics.\",\"uncertainty\":\"Each proposal changes only gamma from a parent with the same D, b and cone. Feasibility is safe except at the g limit, where -3.57026 is within about 1e-4 g of the boundary. Interpolated values are probably good to a few 100 W/m2 and a few tenths of a K. Gains will be tiny because the curve is smooth. I have not found a different region that could shift the front, and the data does not indicate one.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.52 and -1.58 on the shallow end of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":228170,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.04,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the shallow end of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.58 and -1.68.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":229160,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":416.22,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap at gamma -1.65, between -1.62 (D=3.384) and -1.68 (D=3.3852).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.65},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":230220,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":415.42,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.68 and -1.79.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.74},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":232010,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":413.97,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.79 and -1.92.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.85},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":234330,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":412.26,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.92 and -2.08.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.99},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":237360,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":410.14,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap at gamma -2.15. The existing point is at D=3.384, so this is a new point at D=3.3852.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.15},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":240920,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.81,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.22 and -2.36.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.29},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":244105,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":405.85,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.36 and -2.56, first point.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":246645,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":404.37,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.36 and -2.56, second point.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.46},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":248045,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.58,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap at gamma -2.64. The existing -2.65 point is at D=3.375 and is dominated.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.64},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":252275,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":401.27,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the wide gap between gamma -2.72 and -2.95, first point.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.84},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":257030,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":398.87,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front where it is sparse.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the wide gap between gamma -2.72 and -2.95, second point.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":258470,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":398.16,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front where it is sparse.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.95 and -3.16, first point.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.05},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":262060,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.47,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front where it is sparse.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.95 and -3.16, second point.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.1},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":263270,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.91,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front where it is sparse.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.16 and -3.34.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.26},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":267110,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.38 and -3.46.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.42},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":270960,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.56,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.42 and -3.46.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.44},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":271440,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.36,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.49 and -3.53.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.51},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273115,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.67,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Push gamma to the g=12 limit. With slope 1.667 g/deg and an absolute g margin of about 1.4e-4 at -3.5702, gamma -3.57026 should just stay feasible. It extends the steep end by about 6e-5 deg.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.57026},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274555,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.075,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Test the exact g boundary. It gives a marginal extension of the low-T end and risks g infeasibility by about 1e-4.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":70610,"type":"result","duration_ms":104478,"uuid":"e7612209-948f-47fb-8232-e1068fd0e9f9","ttft_stream_ms"